§ `Criminal trespass and house-breaking - ss 441-462`

`a trespass` MEANS `Criminal Trespass Facts` WITH
    particulars                                                                                                                                                                                                         IS `the particulars`
    `the premises`                                                                                                                                                                                                      IS "the flat at Blk 2 Bishan Street 12 #05-233"
    `the person in possession`                                                                                                                                                                                          IS "one Ong Bee Choo"
    `the intended offence`                                                                                                                                                                                              IS "theft"
    `enters into or upon property in the possession of another`                                                                                                                                                         IS TRUE
    `having lawfully entered into or upon such property, unlawfully remains there`                                                                                                                                      IS FALSE
    `with intent to commit an offence`                                                                                                                                                                                  IS TRUE
    `with intent to intimidate, insult or annoy any person in possession of such property`                                                                                                                              IS FALSE
    `any building, tent, container or vessel used as a human dwelling`                                                                                                                                                  IS FALSE
    `any building used as a place for worship or as a place for the custody of property`                                                                                                                                IS FALSE
    `in order to commit any offence punishable with death`                                                                                                                                                              IS FALSE
    `in order to commit any offence punishable with imprisonment for life`                                                                                                                                              IS FALSE
    `in order to commit any offence punishable with imprisonment`                                                                                                                                                       IS FALSE
    `having made preparation for causing hurt to any person, or for assaulting any person, or for wrongfully restraining any person, or for putting any person in fear of hurt or of assault, or of wrongful restraint` IS FALSE
    `having been convicted of an offence under section 449, 450, 451 or 452`                                                                                                                                            IS FALSE
    `causes grievous hurt to any person`                                                                                                                                                                                IS FALSE
    `attempts to cause death or grievous hurt to any person`                                                                                                                                                            IS FALSE
    `any person guilty of such house-breaking voluntarily causes or attempts to cause death or grievous hurt to any person`                                                                                             IS FALSE
    `jointly concerned in committing such house-breaking`                                                                                                                                                               IS FALSE

